@baseURL = http://localhost:3001/api/v2

### Read all users

GET {{baseURL}}/users

### Create a new user
POST {{baseURL}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Mali2",
  "email": "mali2@example.com",
  "password": "pass1234"
}

### Update a user
PUT {{baseURL}}/users/6a9e64b35fc0bc6327043f8f
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "MaliUpdated"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE {{baseURL}}/users/6a9e64b35fc0bc6327043f8f